Deploy this starter with one click on [Vercel](https://vercel.com/):

[![Deploy with Vercel](https://vercel.com/button)](https://vercel.com/new/clone?repository-url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fflotiq%2Fnextjs-starter-boilerplate&env=FLOTIQ_API_KEY&envDescription=Variables%20needed%20for%20the%20application.&envLink=https%3A%2F%2Fflotiq.com%2Fdocs%2FAPI%2F)

