Run and see solutions
```sh
yarn solve
```

Run your tests (wth Jest)
```sh
yarn test
```

Lint your code
```sh
yarn lint
```

## Credits

This project was created with [this 🎄AoC template](https://github.com/caiangums/aoc-template)
