355375554,gitpod-samples,template-sveltekit,https://github.com/gitpod-samples/template-sveltekit,12,14,2021-04-07T01:22:30Z,2025-08-24T20:05:03Z,JavaScript,gitpod-samples/template-sveltekit,False,False,True,False,False,"A SvelteKit template, configured for Gitpod (www.gitpod.io) to give you pre-built, ephemeral development environments in the cloud.",main,https://www.gitpod.io,0,Organization,gitpod-samples,,,14,6,12,True,False,sveltejs; sveltekit; gitpod; template,0,,,,0,,9,False,,,,50,True,True,True,contributor_covenant,False,False,False,False,,,"# A SvelteKit template on Gitpod

This is a [SvelteKit](https://kit.svelte.dev) template configured for ephemeral cloud development environments on [Gitpod](https://www.gitpod.io/).

## Next Steps

Click the button below to start a new development environment:

[![Open in Gitpod](https://gitpod.io/button/open-in-gitpod.svg)](https://gitpod.io/#https://github.com/gitpod-samples/template-sveltekit)

## Get Started With Your Own Project

### A new project

Click the above ""Open in Gitpod"" button to start a new workspace. Once you're ready to push your first code changes, Gitpod will guide you to fork this project so you own it.

