394788729,render-examples,sveltekit,https://github.com/render-examples/sveltekit,16,12,2021-08-10T21:47:09Z,2025-09-13T19:04:43Z,JavaScript,render-examples/sveltekit,False,False,True,False,False,Deploy SvelteKit to Render using the Node.js adapter,main,,1,Organization,render-examples,,,12,5,16,True,False,,0,,,,0,,9,False,,,,25,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,,,"# sveltekit

