Inside of your newly created `.env` file, provide values for each variable. These variables can be found in the [project settings UI](https://hygraph.com/docs/guides/concepts/apis#working-with-apis).

```env
HYGRAPH_ENDPOINT=""""
HYGRAPH_TOKEN=""""
```

3. **Start building!**

