## File Tree
```bash
├── public                # Folder for static assets
│   ├── favicon.png       # Favicon
│   └── index.html        # HTML template
├── src                   # Main folder
│   ├── components        # Subfolder with components
│   │   ├── button.js
│   │   └── container.js
│   │   └── counter.js
│   │   └── header.js
│   │   └── image.js
