<br >

> 👉 **Step #2** - Install dependencies via NPM or yarn

```bash
$ npm i
// OR
$ yarn
```

<br />

> 👉 **Step 3** - Edit the `.env` using the template `.env.sample`. 

```env

REACT_APP_BACKEND_SERVER='http://localhost:5000/api/'

REACT_APP_GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID     = ... # Github OAuth Client
